e juices can dissolve any kind of poison. It can even eat things off the ground.",[17]="When its belly is full, it becomes too lethargic to even lift a finger, so it is safe to bounce on its belly.",[18]="When its belly is full, it becomes too lethargic to even lift a finger, so it is safe to bounce on its belly.",[21]="When its belly is full, it becomes too lethargic to even lift a finger, so it is safe to bounce on its belly.",[22]="When its belly is full, it becomes too lethargic to even lift a finger, so it is safe to bounce on its belly.",[23]="It is not satisfied unless it eats over 880 pounds of food every day. When it is done eating, it goes promptly to sleep.",[24]="Its stomach can digest any kind of food, even if it happens to be moldy or rotten.",[25]="Snorlax’s typical day consists of nothing more than eating and sleeping. It is such a docile Pokémon that there are children who use its expansive belly as a place to play.",[26]="Snorlax’s typical day consists of nothing more than eating and sleeping. It is such a docile Pokémon that there are children who use its expansive belly as a place to play.",[27]="Its stomach is said to be incomparably strong. Even Muk’s poison is nothing more than a hint of spice on Snorlax’s tongue.",[28]="It eats nearly 900 pounds of food every day. It starts nodding off while eating, and continues to eat even while it’s asleep.",[29]="It doesn’t do anything other than eat and sleep. When prompted to make a serious effort, though, it apparently displays awesome power.",[30]="It has no interest in anything other than eating. Even if you climb up on its stomach while it’s napping, it doesn’t seem to mind at all!",[31]="Will eat anything, even if the food happens to be a little moldy. It never gets an upset stomach.",[32]="Will eat anything, even if the food happens to be a little moldy. It never gets an upset stomach.",[33]="It is not satisfied unless it eats over 880 pounds of food every day. When it is done eating, it goes promptly to sleep.",[34]="This Pokémon’s stomach is so strong, even eating moldy or rotten food will not affect it.",[39]="This glutton appears in villages without warning and devours the entirety of their rice granaries, such occurrences have long been counted among the gravest of disasters."},es={[23]="No se encuentra satisfecho hasta que no se come 400 kg de comida cada día. Cuando acaba de comer, se queda dormido.",[24]="Su estómago puede digerir todo tipo de comida, incluso si está podrida o mohosa.",[25]="Un día cualquiera en la vida de Snorlax consiste en comer y dormir. Es un Pokémon tan dócil que es fácil ver niños usando la gran panza que tiene como lugar de juegos.",[26]="Un día cualquiera en la vida de Snorlax consiste en comer y dormir. Es un Pokémon tan dócil que es fácil ver niños usando la gran panza que tiene como lugar de juegos.",[27]="Su estómago es exageradamente resistente. Tanto que podría condimentar su comida con el veneno de Muk sin inmutarse.",[28]="Engulle 400 kg de comida a diario. Si le entra sueño cuando está alimentándose, sigue comiendo mientras echa una cabezada.",[29]="Poco hace aparte de comer y dormir, pero puede desatar una fuerza arrolladora si le da un arrebato.",[30]="Solo piensa en comer y lo demás no le interesa. Cuando duerme la siesta, no se inmuta ni aunque alguien se le tumbe en la barriga.",[31]="Engulle cualquier cosa, incluso comida mohosa, sin que esto le cause dolor de estómago.",[32]="Engulle cualquier cosa, incluso comida mohosa, sin que esto le cause dolor de estómago.",[33]="No se encuentra satisfecho hasta haber ingerido 400 kg de comida cada día. Cuando acaba de comer, se queda dormido.",[34]="Este Pokémon tiene un estómago a prueba de bomba, por lo que es capaz de ingerir incluso comida podrida o mohosa."},pt="Este glutão aparece nas vilas sem aviso e devora todo o arroz dos celeiros. Há muito tempo esses casos são contados entre os piores desastres."},evo={{s=446},{s=143,from=446,c={{t="level-up",happy=160}}}},